            "paragraph": "While a study by Loukas et al. (2003) looked at RAI's performance in temperate climate stations in Greece, where summers often have negative precipitation values, no data on RAI's performance in dry and extremely dry climates are available. In these climates, extended warm dry periods have severely skewed precipitation and produced many zero precipitation data points (Raziei et al. 2015).",
